      "worked_solution": "If $PQRS$ is a square, then $m∠QSP={45}^{∘}.$ Now,  we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m∠QSP & ={45}^{∘} \\\\ (2t+7)^{∘} & ={45}^{∘} \\\\ 2t & =38 \\\\ t & =19.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
