      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14235533/assets/5b2ade26c577b7362460f55397024e3b321a54d769fe1c412f79f38b17f40806.png)\n\nIn a square above, $PO=5\\,mm.$ Find $QS.$",
      "worked_solution": "The diagonals of a square are equal and bisect each other. So we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}QS & =PR \\\\  & =2PO \\\\  & =2\\cdot 5\\,mm \\\\  & =10\\,mm.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
