      "worked_solution": "The diagonals of a square are equal and bisect each other. So we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}QS & =PR \\\\  & =2PO \\\\  & =2\\cdot 2.5\\,m \\\\  & =5\\,m.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
